[I] Feedbackd device themes for different devices

[T] feedbackd-device-themes contains device specific theme files for
[T] feedbackd, the DBus daemon that provides haptic, visual and audio
[T] feedback on events. The themes adapt the feedback to the hardware of
[T] individual phones and tablets.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/agx/feedbackd-device-themes/

[A] Feedbackd-device-themes Authors
